<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6670" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακάμπ-τω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bend convexly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				385b33
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); <i>bend back,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ δ᾽ οὐ πάλιν θυμὸς ἀνεκάμπτετ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					16.82
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make to return,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> mostly intr.,
				<i>bend back, return,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταύτῃ λῆγον ἀ. ἐς τὰ εἴρηται τὸ
					ὄρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ περιφορὰ ἐπ᾽ ἀρχὴν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					407a30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				72b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλιν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GC</u>
					337a6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Sam.</u>
				341
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>walk up and down,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.4.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.796d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.139
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b> in Logic, of
			the terms of a proposition, <i>to be converted,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APo.</u>
				72b36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>de An.</u>
				407a28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>d.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακάμπτων,</span> name of <i>a throw of
				the dice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				57
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
